  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>p>Performance powerhouse! Optimize your daily run with the Nike Vomero 18 Wide. 13% more responsive than previous React technology, these shoes feature a dual-density midsole with ZoomX foam stacked on top of ReactX foam to ensure a comfortable ride. The engineered mesh upper keeps you feeling soft and cool with every giant leap, while the plush tongue and lining wrap your feet in added snugness. Offering maximum cushioning and comfort, the Nike Vomero 18 Wide ensures your every stride is a step toward running greatness.</p> <ul> <li>Pods around the outsole enhance agility and smoother heel-to-toe transitions.</li> <li>MR-10 brings the brand’s most consistent fit.</li> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> <li>Weight: 11.5 oz.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero 18 Wide - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Midnight Navy/Green Spark</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>IF0514-101</td></tr><tr><td